          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Bancos relacionais gerenciados. A AWS cuida do SO, patches, backups, réplicas. Engines suportados: "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "defcb518-101f-490a-93e5-e7fe49a66929",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "content": [
