    },
    {
      "id": "8570181c-6665-4b49-9a97-c8ab3800c17f",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 9,
      "data": {
        "title": "Database Migration Service (DMS)"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "83ec9693-9ea5-4e15-9022-572c3d670aea",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Serviço para migrar bancos on-prem ou entre engines. Suporta homogêneo (Oracle → Oracle) e heterogêneo (Oracle → PostgreSQL). Integra com "
              },
              {
                "text": "AWS Schema Conversion Tool (SCT)",
                "bold": true
              },
              {
                "text": " para converter stored procedures. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "82169536-244e-4015-8a25-5d3e8463435c",
